+    .{ "Alternative use modulus 5^18 and exponent 400. Since 3^400 = (3^20)^20. 3^20=3,486,784,401. Mod 5^18. Could compute powers of 3^20. 3^20 mod 5^18 =", "3^20 mod 5^18", "3486784401" },
